.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-TYPECHECK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-typecheck
.Nd validate RBS signatures and run Zdots seam contract specs
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
validates the RBS type signatures under
.Pa sig/
using
.Ql rbs -I sig validate
and executes the Zdots seam contract test suite under
.Ql rbs/test/setup
runtime instrumentation.
No database or background services are required.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--help"
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage and exit.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-check 1 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 1
